        <p>The commandeering of horses in the War- rington district still continues, and some good " captures " have been reported this week.</p>
        <p>About 2,0011 Men Out. It has been estimated by a local military authority that there are at least 2,000 men from Warrington now engaged on active ser- vice. This figure includes the Territorials. ,</p>
