      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-08-22_WidnesExaminer_art0183" n="art0183">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, AUGUST 22, 1914.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, AUGUST 22, 1914.</p>
        <p>excellence of the French artillery practice and the dash of their infantry. The losses on both sides were heavy. Tfe French succevded in foiling an attempt by the German commander to pass a large body of troops over the Meuse at Dinant.</p>
