      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-08-22_WidnesExaminer_art0208" n="art0208">
        <head>PLEASURE</head>
        <p>PLEASURE</p>
        <p>EHICLES.</p>
        <p>We can give im- mediate delivery of 10 h-p., 20 &amp; 30 h.-p. Touring Cars (your seaters and two seaters), also of covered car.</p>
